 "text": "Hey, how are you doing? Lie down on it in the middle and see where your shoulder blades touch. You want be able to sit with a tall back channel. Was everything okay? Try getting on and off a few times. Move the seat up a little, then try getting on. It should feel close without being too high. You might not fully, which is why a highbar is good to help you up. If you can get on and off without too much of a bend in your knees, it's probably about right.",
